      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your logs indicate a connectivity error (\"connection refused\") rather than an overt resource exhaustion issue like OOMKilled, so check your database endpoint and network policies first. Verify that your liveness probe configuration isn粒tuned incorrectly by halting pod restarts with the `--stop-threshold=0` flag in `kubectl describe`. Finally, review your init script and entrypoint commands to ensure the database credentials are correctly being loaded into environment variables before the container attempts to connect.",
